 to identify  the fakes from the real pills that seems  to be like a smart plan but is there  more we can we can do or law enforcement  can do to protect ourselves and our  nation  oh yes but you know short of a ban or an  embargo on the active ingredients  and you know  detox and rehab and you know all of that  kind of stuff and dealing with um  the effects and the uh  uh the permanent mind altering effects  not to mention all the health uh  problems that arise out of the drug what  pharmaceutical companies and the medical  communities should be working on  is an antidote to counteract these toxic  effects of the drugs because right now  it doesn't seem like they can give the  patients anything when they are  overdosing on the fentanyl so perhaps if  they come out with something to  counteract that at a minimum and in the  short term they can save lives  absolutely no anger is the dea finding  fentanyl in other drugs  yeah they sure are brian and it's being  found in things like cocaine that that's  a stimulant right but fentanyl is being  laced on that cocaine or put into that  cocaine and a lot of these  agents think that that's so the drug  dealers can make their product more  addictive it's also been found in  marijuana as well so a number of drugs  are being laced with this street  fentanyl all right again check out the  dea's website learn get educated and  take care of yourselves and your loved  ones thank you everyone for your update  on this story when we come back a third  ex-officer stands trial and takes the  stand in the death of george floyd our  legal analysts break down the charges  and testimony of ex-officer thomas lane  still ahead on law and crime daily  [Music]  welcome back to long crime daily closing  arguments are presented as the three men  convicted in the death of the mod arbory  stand trial for charges of federal hate  crimes father and son gregory and  trouser michael along with neighbor  william roddy bryan all face federal  hate crime